{"id":1160601,"name":"레타·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"레타·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1160601]}],"trial":{"trial_id":160601,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2023-08-15 14:00:00","diary1":"어느 부유한 사업가 부부가 관리국에 한 통의 편지를 보냈다. 그들은 자신들의 딸, '몽유병'을 앓고 있는 수감자 레타에게 그 편지를 전해달라고 했다.","diary2":"이 편지로 <성장 계획>의 존재를 알게 된 당신은 '슬론 거리의 램프 귀신'의 진상도 함께 자세히 조사해냈다.\n　　제 발로 집을 뛰쳐나온 레타가 당장 자신이 계획한 탐험에 나서겠다고 하는 바람에 당신은 허락하고 그녀와 동행할 수밖에 없었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260397,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260398,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":260601001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":1,"dialogue_id":260601006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":6,"dialogue_id":1,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260601